  <name>Open Legato</name>
  <summary>Sheet-music reader for musicians</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      Open Legato is a cross-platform sheet-music reader built for musicians. It 
      provides fast page flips, and fullscreen performance mode. </p>
    <p>Features:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Configurable touch buttons</li>
      <li>Dual-page spread mode in landscape orientation</li>
      <li>Repeat buttons to jump between sections</li>
      <li>Bookmarks</li>
      <li>Library to open files quickly</li>
    </ul>
  </description>
